# CCS Intelligence Dashboard — Mimari

## Proje Bağlamı

Mevcut **Customer Success Pulse** uygulaması üzerine inşa edilen Meeting Intelligence, PM Performance ve Sales Pipeline platformu.

## Tech Stack

```
Frontend:   React 19 + TypeScript + Vite
UI:         Tailwind CSS + Lucide React
Charts:     Recharts
Auth:       Clerk (email domain: alo-tech.com / callcenterstudio.com)
Backend:    Vercel Serverless Functions
Database:   SQLite (dev) / Vercel Postgres (prod)
State:      Zustand (dataStore)
CSV:        PapaParse
Deploy:     Vercel
```

## Veri Kaynakları

| Kaynak | Nasıl Alınır |
|--------|--------------|
| `meetings_master` | Google Sheets CSV export |
| `pm_scores` | Google Sheets CSV export |
| `customer_insights` | Google Sheets CSV export |
| `risk_signals` | Google Sheets CSV export |
| `knowledge_management` | Google Sheets CSV export |
| `Sales_Orders` (Pipeline) | Zoho CRM CSV export |
| `Sales_Orders_2` (Live) | Zoho CRM CSV export |
| Tenant verisi | Mevcut SQLite/Postgres DB |

